<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Misty</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lesley Gore</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">I'll Cry If I Want To</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2exbololsmP1XM2gmBEvAW</ttm:item><itunes:duration>02:18.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.000" end="00:05.650">Look at me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.650" end="00:11.750">I'm hopeless as a kitten up a tree</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.750" end="00:16.330">And I feel like I'm clinging to a cloud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.330" end="00:20.180">I can't understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.180" end="00:28.180">I get misty , just holding your hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.380" end="00:34.420">Walk my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.420" end="00:41.070">And a thousand violins begin to play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.070" end="00:45.530">Or it might be sound of your hello</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.530" end="00:49.040">That musical I hear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.040" end="00:57.040">I get misty , the moment you're near</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.350" end="01:05.470">You can say that you're leading me on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.470" end="01:12.850">But it's just what I want you to do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.850" end="01:19.840">Don't you notice I hopelessly I'm lost</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.840" end="01:27.130">That's why I following you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.130" end="01:33.750">On my own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.750" end="01:39.930">I wander through this wonderland alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.930" end="01:45.250">Even know my right foot from my left</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.250" end="01:48.280">My hat from my glove</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.280" end="01:56.280">I'm too misty , and too much in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.650" end="02:01.650">I'm too misty ,and I'm too much in love</p></div></body></tt>